msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the goya burger over at the Smile Burger in Downtown "
"Ryukyu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "The goya burger? Yeah, I get it all the time. What about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Did you know you can only get them here in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Oh! Y'know, now that you mention it, you're right! I saw that written on the"
" menu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I was so used to getting it over here, I guess I didn't realize you couldn't"
" get it on the mainland."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"If you can only get it here, it must be pretty rare. That's one cool burger,"
" huh? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You're right about that."
msgstr "Su questo hai ragione..."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I heard the rafute soba over at the Okinawan Soba place in the Kariyushi "
"Arcade is really delicious, and rich in collagen, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"I dunno about that collagen thing, but they're right about that soba! Their "
"noodles are soooo good. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"I like the tebichi soba way better than the rafute one,\r\n"
"though. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"The meat is suuuuper soft and juicy, and totally delicious! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default> You should give it a try, Kiryu-san! You'll "
"definitely like it! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the \"legendary\" appetizer they have at Aqua Sky in "
"Hatsumachi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"A legendary appetizer? I dunno what it is, but it sounds pretty important!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Here's the thing... it's just salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Salt!? Salt is the appetizer of legends!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Apparently, it's a rare salt that's only made on a tiny island here in"
" Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Oh, okay... It's just regular salt, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Not only that, it has this hint of sweetness to it that brings out the"
" flavor in alcoholic drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Huuuuh... Sounds like something a big drinker would like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a kind of shochu made with red "
"perilla."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Yup. I drink it every now and then, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! I know a super yummy way to drink Tantakatan! Wanna know what it "
"is? <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"You gotta mix it with cranberry juice! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Once you "
"take that first sip, you won't be able to stop! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Hahaha. Sounds like you're pretty into it."
msgstr ""

