msgctxt "796"
msgid "Have you ever had the goya burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and you can only get it here, right? You told me about it before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Oh, yeah. You're right."
msgstr "Ah, sì. Hai ragione."

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"You're a bit of a ditz, aren't you, Kiryu-san? That's no good! You gotta "
"remember stuff like this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Have you heard about the rafute soba at Okinawan Soba?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Yeah! The lady who works there is super nice. I went there to eat once with "
"my brother, and she gave us two tebichi sobas⑬on the house! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Wow, that's nice of her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> She's sooo sweet. No wonder the place is "
"so great. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Have you heard of the \"legendary\" appetizer they've got over at Aqua Sky?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that rare salt? I like to order something meaty when I drink, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Gotcha..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"I usually go for rafute or grilled agu, something I can chew and savor. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Have you ever heard of Tantakatan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm, it's great. I always recommend it to our guests\r\n"
"here, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"I mean, if we're gonna be drinking here, I kinda want us to drink something "
"I like, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Ehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"It's so smooth and easy to sip. I just love Tantakatan. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

